 - Caller identity is exact/bounded; an empty caller allowlist denies all.
 - Empty permitted-effects means effect-free `NONE` only, never unconstrained.
 - Qualification and provenance standing must be externally established.
-- Health observation is mandatory, monotonic and TTL-bound; missing/expired/unhealthy/zero-slot is ineligible.
+- Health observation is mandatory, monotonic and TTL-bound; missing/expired/unhealthy/zero-slot is ineligible. Health observation identity is globally unique: an identical observation replay remains idempotent even after newer health exists, while reuse of the same observation ID for different content or a different descriptor fails closed.
 - Degraded health is eligible only when explicitly allowed by the requirement.
 - Discovery is deterministic and bounded to at most 64 evaluated candidates.
 - Every route decision binds the exact requirement digest, selected descriptor digest, selected implementation digest, selected health observation and complete candidate-evaluation list.
